                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "Volleyball"
                  },
                  {
                    "alias": "bio",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "Layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EI coach Freshman/Sophomore Volleyball during 6th period and after school. Volleyball tryouts start every spring and all through summer. Summer league is for the month of July and tryouts for incoming freshmen start the last 3 weeks of August. (usually around the 13th). I am one of the Girls League (service club) advisers, and the club meets every Tues. at lunch.\u003C/p\u003E"
                    }
                  },
